  "description": "NEMFOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H74 Dy4 N6 O20. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.476-3.855 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.27-112.43°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C70H74N6O20Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Dy(III).",
